            "tabs": {
              "type": "yv-product-tabs",
              "settings": {
                "show_description": true,
                "description_open": true,
                "content_style": "accordion",
                "content_alignment": "left",
                "tab_1_heading": "Delivery & returns",
                "tab_1_content": "<p><strong>Delivery.</strong> Our own stock is dispatched within 1 to 2 working days. Standard delivery is free on every order and takes 4 to 6 working days after dispatch; Express is £6.99, 2 to 3 working days after dispatch. Tracking comes by email as soon as it's on its way, and the dates above the button are worked out for an order placed today.</p><p>A few beds ship from our partner warehouse or are made to order and take longer. Their page says so above the button, so message us for the expected date before you order.</p><p><strong>Returns.</strong> Every bed except personalised items comes with 100 nights to decide. Tell us any time inside them and we collect it free from the UK mainland, slept on, hair and all, and refund you in full. One trial per household. Full terms: <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">refund policy</a> and <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">shipping policy</a>.</p>",
                "tab_2_heading": "Guarantee",
                "tab_2_content": "<p>The 5-year foam guarantee covers the memory foam core of every PawLunova memory foam bed. If the core loses its shape under normal domestic use within 5 years, we replace it. Whether this bed is covered is shown in the \"Included with this bed\" list above.</p><p>Covers, zips, liners, waterproof layers, bolsters, fibre filling and non-slip bases are wearing parts and aren't included. Nor is damage from chewing, scratching, tearing or accidents, foam damaged by liquid (including urine) or by washing, softening that recovers when the bed is empty, or commercial use.</p>",
                "tab_3_heading": "",
                "tab_3_content": ""
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
