        "heading": "The bit nobody mentions until February.",
        "lede": "A bed that can't be washed is a bed you'll throw away. Here's how the [bed] stays a bed you'd let in the living room.",
        "wash_heading": "Washing it",
        "accident_heading": "Accidents and wet dogs",
        "spare_heading": "One on the bed, one in the wash",
        "spare_product": "",
        "spare_text": "A second cover means the [bed] is never out of action on wash day, and the old-bed smell never gets a foothold.",
        "spare_fallback": "Ask us about a spare cover before you order. A second cover means the bed is never out of action on wash day.",
        "care_link": "/pages/care-guide",
        "note": "If it arrives rolled or vacuum-packed, unroll it somewhere ventilated and give it a few hours to come back to full depth before they try it.",
        "tone": "page"
      }
    },
